"Implemented (commit 258a0ac). Server: account.rs with accounts (unique name), account_identities (identity PK -> account), login_requests/login_responses as persistent never-pruned security records, login_request_voters (voter snapshot at request time), scheduled finalize_login timer for the 30s post-quorum window; create_account / request_login / respond_login reducers; quorum = accepts*2 >= voters, any refusal fails immediately, acceptance on all-responded or quorum+30s. No implicit accounts: create_account creates the account AND its player from the new-player blob; identity_connected only cancels deactivation for attached identities; PlayerControllerComponent.identity replaced by account_id (raw u64, deliberately not EntityId so it never becomes an entity selector); act/from_player_identity resolve identity->account at the boundary. Web: AccountGate (unattached -> AccountPanel with separate new-account and login input sets; attached -> game + LoginRequestsPrompt accept/refuse); account tables subscribed; player hook resolves via account. E2E phase 6 (test-e2e-login, added to the test-e2e bundle): dup-name rejection, request->confirm->attach, refusal kills request (even with a second voter unresponded), requester cannot vote, unattached cannot act. NOT covered: the 30s delay branch (needs a silent voter + real clock; candidate for dev-inject-premade-state hooks later). Full gate green (cargo test, clippy, web check, 101 unit, e2e 0-6)."